Release scope
-------------

A CardputerZero OS release can contain these distinct artifacts:

* A device image built with pi-gen. Its Debian, Raspberry Pi and other
  distribution packages retain their package-specific copyright and license
  material in the image, including /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright where
  provided by the package.
* A host-native App DevKit archive. It contains CardputerZero source, a cp0ctl
  binary built from the Rust workspace, SDK sources, simulator sources, sample
  applications, documentation and the App development Skill.
* A standalone archive of the CardputerZero App development Skill.

The web control-plane applications and their npm dependency trees are not
included in the device image, App DevKit, or standalone Skill archive. Their
package-lock.json files are the authoritative dependency records when those
applications are separately distributed.

